      "instance_name": "man",
      "label": "Black man",
      "description": "A Black man with a serious, intense expression, looking directly at the camera. He has short dark hair, visible facial stubble, and is wearing a brightly patterned shirt with yellow, white, and blue floral or geometric designs. His skin tone is dark, and his eyes are a striking amber or brown color. The background is a textured, reddish-brown brick or mud wall, suggesting an outdoor or rustic setting. The man's expression and the context of the overlaid text suggest a tone of warning or moral instruction.",
