      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "anti_black_stereotype_hypersexualization",
      "label": "Anti-Black Stereotype: Hypersexualization",
      "description": "The meme implicitly relies on the stereotype that Black men are inherently promiscuous or sexually driven, which is used to justify the moralistic warning about having multiple girlfriends. This stereotype is a form of racialized misogyny and is commonly used to pathologize Black male sexuality and behavior.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
