      "instance_name": "serious_warning",
      "label": "serious warning expression",
      "description": "The man's intense, direct gaze and solemn facial expression convey a tone of stern admonishment or moral instruction, as if delivering a grave warning to the viewer. His unsmiling, focused look reinforces the gravity of the overlaid text's message.",
