      "label": "Racialized Misogyny",
      "description": "The meme combines racial stereotypes about Black men with misogynistic tropes, implying that Black men are inherently prone to financial irresponsibility and relationship instability due to having multiple partners, while also suggesting women are financial assets to be 'invested in'. This intersection of racism and misogyny is a key element of the meme's harmful intent.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
